    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/38b35afa3106d8bc15989cb8a20c21f3.avif?t=1754395391\" data-has-big /></div></p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/2d07a87263132b8045efefa2c42f6b75.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shipwrecked on a mysterious 17th-century island teeming with deadly threats and secrets to uncover. There is no hand-holding, no second chances - only instinct, skill, and grit. A ruthless roguelike where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/5618545f9731c7861fd8a830b34e06d2.poster.avif?t=1754395391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/5618545f9731c7861fd8a830b34e06d2.webm?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/5618545f9731c7861fd8a830b34e06d2.mp4?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/d0f8609d6c2a8a922f2188d062561c76.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A highly realistic, systems-driven world where everything reacts. Day and night cycles, weather, fire, and liquids interact in complex ways - creating endless, unpredictable challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/17acbef847a7996bbb5277db67efd71c.poster.avif?t=1754395391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/17acbef847a7996bbb5277db67efd71c.webm?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/17acbef847a7996bbb5277db67efd71c.mp4?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/b0b96acd6b1daa81e33d177c11d4f5f1.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is progress - learn by doing, adapt your strategy, and unlock new items to push your survival further than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/93175774f356494975401790e26248a7.poster.avif?t=1754395391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/93175774f356494975401790e26248a7.webm?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/93175774f356494975401790e26248a7.mp4?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/6ae81f8905a5cac4322a60c3082ca425.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is unique. Each new session reshuffles resources, events, and outcomes - pushing you to experiment, and discover something new with every survival attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/9f75be4fd59b04c16ce16da6e9c44251.poster.avif?t=1754395391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/9f75be4fd59b04c16ce16da6e9c44251.webm?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/9f75be4fd59b04c16ce16da6e9c44251.mp4?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/5c07bb6371194a53c5b0810ad417735c.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the story of the survivor - life before the shipwreck, and the uncertain future that awaits on the island. There must be a reason you were spared while the others were not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/d1d62f344d6fcf455a7acf072cf6ad69.poster.avif?t=1754395391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/d1d62f344d6fcf455a7acf072cf6ad69.webm?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/d1d62f344d6fcf455a7acf072cf6ad69.mp4?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/5bb39689bf582ab4dace78da2f7690a0.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/64a13e202914288518e2b747144275da.webp?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cBootstrap Island is the Most Realistic VR Game I've Ever Played. Bootstrap Island blew me away. I have played a lot of VR survival games but Bootstrap Island has the best VR survival mechanics I've ever seen.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/968f981b38842aec6fd63a6a4982ab4a.webp?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cPCVR has been neglected for many new releases in the VR scene and now we finally got a diamond in the rough. Welcome to BOOTSTRAP ISLAND!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/ef7beef98deea4b150ae0b8ccc52bb3a.webp?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cThe Next Gen VR Survival Experience that makes you want to stay...Bootstrap Island is incredibly detailed and for the first time in actually 2 years I did not want to put my headset off.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/3ed104f14aa2d082047fc65c50967cf0.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/16e993c1cf533f0f401ab767feba7d75.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-funded by the European Union. Co-funded by European Union Creative Europe Media. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/1eb2415395ab5b0e144345f9b32b9175.webp?t=1754395391\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/2d07a87263132b8045efefa2c42f6b75.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shipwrecked on a mysterious 17th-century island teeming with deadly threats and secrets to uncover. There is no hand-holding, no second chances - only instinct, skill, and grit. A ruthless roguelike where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/5618545f9731c7861fd8a830b34e06d2.poster.avif?t=1754395391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/5618545f9731c7861fd8a830b34e06d2.webm?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/5618545f9731c7861fd8a830b34e06d2.mp4?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/d0f8609d6c2a8a922f2188d062561c76.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A highly realistic, systems-driven world where everything reacts. Day and night cycles, weather, fire, and liquids interact in complex ways - creating endless, unpredictable challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/17acbef847a7996bbb5277db67efd71c.poster.avif?t=1754395391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/17acbef847a7996bbb5277db67efd71c.webm?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/17acbef847a7996bbb5277db67efd71c.mp4?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/b0b96acd6b1daa81e33d177c11d4f5f1.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is progress - learn by doing, adapt your strategy, and unlock new items to push your survival further than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/93175774f356494975401790e26248a7.poster.avif?t=1754395391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/93175774f356494975401790e26248a7.webm?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/93175774f356494975401790e26248a7.mp4?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/6ae81f8905a5cac4322a60c3082ca425.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is unique. Each new session reshuffles resources, events, and outcomes - pushing you to experiment, and discover something new with every survival attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/9f75be4fd59b04c16ce16da6e9c44251.poster.avif?t=1754395391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/9f75be4fd59b04c16ce16da6e9c44251.webm?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/9f75be4fd59b04c16ce16da6e9c44251.mp4?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/5c07bb6371194a53c5b0810ad417735c.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the story of the survivor - life before the shipwreck, and the uncertain future that awaits on the island. There must be a reason you were spared while the others were not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/d1d62f344d6fcf455a7acf072cf6ad69.poster.avif?t=1754395391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/d1d62f344d6fcf455a7acf072cf6ad69.webm?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/d1d62f344d6fcf455a7acf072cf6ad69.mp4?t=1754395391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/5bb39689bf582ab4dace78da2f7690a0.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/64a13e202914288518e2b747144275da.webp?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cBootstrap Island is the Most Realistic VR Game I've Ever Played. Bootstrap Island blew me away. I have played a lot of VR survival games but Bootstrap Island has the best VR survival mechanics I've ever seen.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/968f981b38842aec6fd63a6a4982ab4a.webp?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cPCVR has been neglected for many new releases in the VR scene and now we finally got a diamond in the rough. Welcome to BOOTSTRAP ISLAND!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/ef7beef98deea4b150ae0b8ccc52bb3a.webp?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cThe Next Gen VR Survival Experience that makes you want to stay...Bootstrap Island is incredibly detailed and for the first time in actually 2 years I did not want to put my headset off.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/3ed104f14aa2d082047fc65c50967cf0.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/16e993c1cf533f0f401ab767feba7d75.avif?t=1754395391\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-funded by the European Union. Co-funded by European Union Creative Europe Media. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/1eb2415395ab5b0e144345f9b32b9175.webp?t=1754395391\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Stranded in the 17th century after a brutal shipwreck, you awaken alone on a deadly tropical island. To survive, you\u2019ll need to learn fast - facing wild beasts, nature\u2019s wrath, and uncovering secrets hidden deep in the jungle. Every step is a fight for your life.",
